          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            Physicists often refer to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spaces"} spaces
            in
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergeometry"} supergeometry
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supermanifolds"} supermanifolds
            or
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super+schemes"} super schemes
            = succeed "." do
              %em superspaces
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super+vector+space"} super vector space
            over real or complex numbers), superscheme, supermanifold, etc.
          %p
            Mostly however “superspace” is used for
            = succeed "," do
